        "jsCode": "// VPS_HOST set -> a VPS exists: skip to readiness. Otherwise GATE-VPS: one to-do for Jonathan (batched with other gates).\nconst L = require('lv-automation').subW26;\nreturn { json: L.firstPaymentPlan($json, $env) };"
